Objective: Verify that high-RPM fan noise masks player footstep audio.

Systemic Logic (C++ Integration): The BraxtigAudioSubsystem calculates the current RPM of the SpinFan take from allpre.fbx. When RPM > 3000, the player's NoiseEmitterComponent is suppressed by 90%.

C++
// AudioOcclusion.cpp
void UBraxtigAudioSubsystem::ApplyRPMOcclusion(AActor* Player) {
    float FanRPM = GetFanRPMFromCoords(400.0f, 283.0f, 204.0f);
    
    if (FanRPM >= 3000.0f) {
        // Occlusion Active: Footsteps are masked by industrial scream
        Player->GetNoiseEmitter()->SetModifier(0.1f);
        unreal::log("Shadow Stealth: Audio Occluded by SpinFan_70");
    }
}
